# Internal design notes. Not published.
#
# dev-notes/ names real client sites and quotes their logs, which is what makes
# it useful while designing and what must not become public. Source comments
# cite it as `dev-notes/NN`; those are citations to an archive you may not have,
# not broken links.
dev-notes/

# Local agent configuration. Deliberately this one file and not `.claude/`,
# which also holds shared project configuration.
.claude/settings.local.json

# Captured log extracts and status-page dumps used as test input during
# development. Real hosts, real client traffic.
var/

vendor/
*.log
*~
